OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely wet start with
OL,6,Fpersistent rain for many. Perhaps
OL,7,Fdrier for a time, but risk of showers
OL,8,Fand further rain arriving later. Winds
OL,9,Falso strengthening, with coastal gales
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with showers to start,
OL,13,Fbecoming more settled and drier
OL,14,Fovernight, clearing skies as the rain
OL,15,Fmoves eastwards into the North Sea.
OL,16,FWinds will ease slightly by the
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
